{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212470","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212470","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1121247001:1":{"text":"I was waiting for them to open their eyes... I thought they'd wake up by morning.","source_cn":"我一直在等它们睁开眼睛，我想等到天亮的时候，它们就会醒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F77A16460DDC9FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121247002:0":{"text":"But the sun has been rising steadily.","source_cn":"可是，今天的太阳，升起得好慢啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC0AFF736656E3BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121247003:0":{"text":"I noticed that their smell changed... they smell almost fishy. I tried to call out to them, but nothing worked.","source_cn":"我发现，它们的味道也变了，变得腥臭。我试着呼唤过它们，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EAB043FD80886E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1121247003":{"text":"I noticed that their smell changed... they smell almost fishy. I tried to call out to them, but nothing worked.","source_cn":"我发现，它们的味道也变了，变得腥臭。我试着呼唤过它们，没有用。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EAB043FD80886E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1121247004:0":{"text":"The birds' bodies, yet to be buried, have started to rot due to the weather...","source_cn":"由于没有及时埋葬，受天气影响，小鸟的尸体已经有些腐坏了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFE37B398E2085A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121247005:0":{"text":"So Lenya and that little boy were telling the truth. Mother lied to me.","source_cn":"蕾米雅和那个小男孩没有骗我，是妈妈骗了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20728BC5EFA6F66D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1121247006:0":{"text":"Mother, what's wrong with those people? Why aren't they moving? I heard someone say they're dead.","source_cn":"妈妈，那些人怎么了？为什么一动不动？我听到有人说，他们死了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x255DECC501C5B6D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121247007:0":{"text":"Silly lies. They're just asleep.","source_cn":"傻孩子，他们是睡着了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF8D22FE6C64EB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1121247008:0":{"text":"When will they wake up?","source_cn":"什么时候会醒过来呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAFF5DB72DA4BEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1121247009:1":{"text":"When they finish their beautiful dreams.","source_cn":"等他们做完美梦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7321A9FC4D9A93D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1121247010:0":{"text":"Death is silent, cold, smelly, and can look so bad.","source_cn":"死亡，会沉默、会冰冷、会腥臭，会变成各种糟糕的模样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3278BF31295B864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1121247011:0":{"text":"And... no one wakes up.","source_cn":"唯独……不会醒来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69B2EC493A719C83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1121247012:0":{"text":"The old me has done awful, awful things!","source_cn":"以前的我，做了很坏很坏的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180B1B05FB05555A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1121247012":{"text":"The old me has done awful, awful things!","source_cn":"以前的我，做了很坏很坏的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x180B1B05FB05555A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1121247013:0":{"text":"I don't deserve comfort, but thank you... You're a kind person.","source_cn":"我不值得受到安慰……但是，谢谢你，你是一个温柔的人。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x70D5E609409D6ECA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I don't deserve comfort, but thank you... You're a kind person.","female":"I don't deserve comfort, but thank you... You're a kind person.","variant_male_record_index":"117362","variant_female_record_index":"117363","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1121247015:0":{"text":"What should I do with these little birds? They shouldn't be left here.","source_cn":"这些小鸟，我应该怎么办？我不希望它们被放在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D45F8F0CCDA7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1121247015":{"text":"What should I do with these little birds? They shouldn't be left here.","source_cn":"这些小鸟，我应该怎么办？我不希望它们被放在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50D45F8F0CCDA7E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1121247016:0":{"text":"I've heard this forest has its own goddess, and people worship it at an altar in the village.","source_cn":"听说，这片丛林有自己信奉的神明，村子里就有那位神明的小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x397724881F2D5C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1121247017:0":{"text":"I'd like to bury the birds near it. Can you show me the way? Please.","source_cn":"我想把小鸟埋葬在那附近。你能为我带路吗？拜托了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDAEBDF34C96550BF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I'd like to bury the birds near it. Can you show me the way? Please.","female":"I'd like to bury the birds near it. Can you show me the way? Please.","variant_male_record_index":"117367","variant_female_record_index":"117368","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:18:0:1":{"text":"Bury them.","source_cn":"将它们埋葬吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4E2F033048C9A563","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Bury them.","female":"Bury them.","variant_male_record_index":"62818","variant_female_record_index":"62819","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"It wasn't your fault.","source_cn":"（试图安慰）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x34285C9ACC54CEFA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"It wasn't your fault.","female":"It wasn't your fault.","variant_male_record_index":"62814","variant_female_record_index":"62815","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1121247014:0":{"text":"I want to try and make up for my past... even if much of it can't be undone.","source_cn":"我希望能够弥补自己的过错，尽管……或许根本无法弥补。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC365E02BE8BC7E62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"You know what you should do now.","source_cn":"（批评教育）","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x962BEECC74F694E1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You know what you should do now.","female":"You know what you should do now."